{"symbol":"BHAGGAS","yahoo":"BHAGGAS.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Bhagawati Gas Limited","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Water","website":"https://www.bglgroup.in","about":"Bhagawati Gas Limited engages in the cleaning of water bodies business in India. The company is involved in the treatment of the wastewater and waterbodies, such as river, lake, pond, drain, etc., as well as industrial effluents using Phycoremediation technology. It also engages in the supply and installation of medical oxygen gas plant; offers oxygen through pipeline to copper smelter; produces customized glass reinforced polymer (GRP) pipes and other GRP pultruded products; and sets up air separation plant for production of oxygen, nitrogen, and argon. The company was formerly known as Bhagawati Gases Limited and changed its name to Bhagawati Gas Limited on October 23, 2009. Bhagawati Gas Limited was incorporated in 1974 and is based in New Delhi, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:12:30+00:00","quote":{"price":8.78,"prevClose":8.37,"marketCap":14.7,"high52":13.15,"low52":0.53,"pe":13.94,"bookValue":8.98,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":1.6742,"insiders":40.41,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2016-09-26","2016-09-27","2016-09-28","2016-09-29","2016-09-30","2016-10-03","2016-10-04","2016-10-05","2016-10-06","2016-10-07","2016-10-10","2016-10-13","2016-10-14","2016-10-17","2016-10-18","2016-10-19","2016-10-20","2016-10-21","2016-10-24","2016-10-25","2016-10-26","2016-10-27","2016-10-28","2016-11-01","2016-11-02","2016-11-03","2016-11-04","2016-11-07","2016-11-08","2016-11-09","2016-11-10","2016-11-11","2016-11-15","2016-11-16","2016-11-17","2016-11-18","2016-11-21","2016-11-22","2016-11-23","2016-11-24","2016-11-25","2016-11-28","2016-11-29","2016-11-30","2016-12-01","2016-12-02","2016-12-05","2016-12-06","2016-12-07","2016-12-08","2016-12-09","2016-12-12","2016-12-13","2016-12-14","2016-12-15","2016-12-16","2016-12-19","2016-12-20","2016-12-21","2016-12-22